---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use — AI Zodiac"
  description="Terms of Use for the AI Zodiac mobile application and website. Understand the terms governing access, intellectual property, entertainment disclaimers, and service usage."
>
  <div class="legal-page-container">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="legal-breadcrumbs">
        <a href="/" class="back-link">
          <span>&larr;</span> Back to AI Zodiac Home
        </a>
      </div>

      <article class="glass-card legal-card">
        <header class="legal-header">
          <div class="legal-badge-row">
            <span class="badge badge-gold">Official Terms</span>
            <span class="legal-date">Last updated: September 17, 2026</span>
          </div>
          <h1 class="legal-title">AI Zodiac <span class="gradient-text">Terms of Use</span></h1>
          <p class="legal-lead">
            These Terms of Use constitute a legally binding agreement between you and <strong>AI Zodiac</strong> governing your access to and use of our mobile application, website, and associated services.
          </p>
        </header>

        <div class="legal-content">
          <section>
            <h2>1. Agreement to Terms</h2>
            <p>
              These Terms of Use ("Terms") constitute a legally binding agreement between you and the developers and operators of <strong>AI Zodiac</strong> ("we", "us", or "our"), governing your access to and use of the <strong>AI Zodiac</strong> mobile application, the website located at <code>https://aizodiac.life/</code>, and any associated serverless backend services (collectively, the "Services").
            </p>
            <p>
              By downloading, installing, accessing, or using the Services, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by these Terms. If you do not agree with these Terms, you must discontinue using the Services immediately.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>2. Eligibility &amp; Age Requirements</h2>
            <p>
              The Services are intended solely for individuals who are at least 13 years of age (or 16 years of age in the European Economic Area or where applicable local law requires parental consent). By using AI Zodiac, you represent and warrant that you meet this age requirement.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>3. Description of Services &amp; Architecture</h2>
            <p>
              AI Zodiac provides personalized astrological interpretations, natal chart calculations, daily and personal horoscopes, Chinese zodiac insights, numerology readings, love compatibility analysis, personal astrological calendars, and interactive celestial queries ("Ask the Stars" / "Ask AI").
            </p>
            <p>
              The application operates on a decentralized, privacy-first model:
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li><strong>Local Device Storage:</strong> Your personal profile and birth parameters are stored exclusively on your Android device (using private <code>SharedPreferences</code>). No cloud user account, username, or password is required or stored.</li>
              <li><strong>Backend Computation:</strong> When you generate a horoscope or reading, your query parameters are processed in real time by the AI Zodiac backend and cached transiently for performance and operational rate limiting.</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>4. Nature of Content &amp; Astrological Disclaimers</h2>
            <div class="legal-callout">
              <p>
                <strong>Entertainment &amp; Personal Reflection Only:</strong> All horoscope readings, astrological forecasts, compatibility assessments, and celestial answers provided by AI Zodiac are generated for entertainment, personal reflection, and spiritual curiosity purposes only.
              </p>
            </div>
            <p>
              Astrological interpretations and AI-generated outputs do not constitute professional, medical, psychiatric, psychological, legal, financial, or investment advice. You should never rely on astrological insights as a substitute for professional counsel. You remain solely responsible for any decisions or actions you take.
            </p>
            <p>
              For complete details regarding our AI inference mechanisms and content boundaries, please review our <a href="/disclaimer">AI &amp; Content Disclaimer</a>.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>5. Intellectual Property Rights &amp; Limited License</h2>
            <p>
              All right, title, and interest in and to the AI Zodiac mobile application, website, logos, designs, source code, astrological synthesis logic, graphic assets, and text content are the intellectual property of <strong>AI Zodiac</strong> and its licensors.
            </p>
            <p>
              Subject to your compliance with these Terms, we grant you a limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable, non-sublicensable, revocable license to download, install, and use the AI Zodiac application on your personal Android device solely for personal, non-commercial purposes.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>6. Prohibited Activities</h2>
            <p>When using AI Zodiac, you agree not to:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Decompile, reverse-engineer, disassemble, or attempt to derive the source code of the mobile app or backend APIs.</li>
              <li>Access, tamper with, or scrape the backend APIs or caching infrastructure through automated scripts, bots, spiders, or unauthorized software.</li>
              <li>Circumvent or attempt to circumvent security controls, rate limits, token budgets, or authentication mechanisms.</li>
              <li>Use the Services for any unlawful, fraudulent, harassing, or abusive purpose.</li>
              <li>Resell, sublicense, redistribute, or commercially exploit any content generated by the Services without express written consent.</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>7. Artificial Intelligence Inference &amp; External Providers</h2>
            <p>
              AI Zodiac utilizes state-of-the-art artificial intelligence models provided by <strong>Google Gemini</strong> and <strong>Groq</strong> to synthesize natural-language astrological readings. Due to the probabilistic nature of machine learning, generated content may occasionally contain creative interpretations, variations, or inaccuracies. We do not guarantee the completeness, accuracy, or timeliness of any AI-generated response.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>8. Third-Party Services &amp; Advertising</h2>
            <p>
              The AI Zodiac mobile application is distributed via the <strong>Google Play Store</strong> and displays advertisements served by <strong>Google AdMob</strong> (Google LLC). Your interactions with Google Play and Google AdMob are subject to their respective terms and privacy policies.
            </p>
            <p>
              The AI Zodiac website does not host third-party advertisements or affiliate referral links.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>9. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
            <p class="uppercase-legal">
              THE SERVICES ARE PROVIDED ON AN "AS IS" AND "AS AVAILABLE" BASIS, WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND, EITHER EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO IMPLIED WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, TITLE, AND NON-INFRINGEMENT. WE DO NOT WARRANT THAT THE SERVICES WILL BE UNINTERRUPTED, ERROR-FREE, SECURE, OR ACCURATE.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>10. Limitation of Liability</h2>
            <p class="uppercase-legal">
              TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY APPLICABLE LAW, IN NO EVENT SHALL AI ZODIAC, ITS DEVELOPERS, OPERATORS, OR ANY ASSOCIATED CONTRIBUTORS BE LIABLE FOR ANY INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, OR PUNITIVE DAMAGES, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO LOSS OF DATA, LOSS OF PROFITS, PERSONAL DECISIONS MADE IN RELIANCE ON ASTROLOGICAL READINGS, OR SERVICE INTERRUPTIONS, ARISING OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH YOUR ACCESS TO OR USE OF (OR INABILITY TO USE) THE SERVICES.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>11. Modifications to Terms</h2>
            <p>
              We reserve the right to revise or update these Terms at any time. When modifications occur, the "Last updated" date at the top of this document will be updated. Your continued use of AI Zodiac following the posting of revised Terms constitutes your acceptance of the changes.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>12. Contact Information</h2>
            <p>
              If you have questions, inquiries, or legal notices concerning these Terms of Use, you may reach out through our <a href="/contact">Contact Page</a> or via the official <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.oberon.aizodiac" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">AI Zodiac Google Play Developer Listing</a>.
            </p>
          </section>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-crosslinks">
          <h3 class="crosslinks-heading">Related Legal Documents</h3>
          <div class="crosslinks-grid">
            <a href="/privacy-policy" class="crosslink-card">
              <span class="crosslink-title">Privacy Policy &rarr;</span>
              <span class="crosslink-desc">Local-first data handling and privacy protections</span>
            </a>
            <a href="/disclaimer" class="crosslink-card">
              <span class="crosslink-title">AI &amp; Content Disclaimer &rarr;</span>
              <span class="crosslink-desc">Entertainment boundaries and non-reliance guidelines</span>
            </a>
            <a href="/contact" class="crosslink-card">
              <span class="crosslink-title">Contact &amp; Support &rarr;</span>
              <span class="crosslink-desc">Get in touch with the AI Zodiac development team</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page-container {
    padding: 3rem 0 5rem;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 10%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.07) 0%, transparent 60%);
  }

  .legal-breadcrumbs {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: #7dd3fc;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .legal-card {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3.5rem 3rem;
  }

  .legal-header {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
    padding-bottom: 2.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .legal-badge-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .legal-date {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .legal-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .legal-lead {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .legal-content section {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .legal-content h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-purple);
    padding-left: 0.85rem;
  }

  .legal-content p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .legal-content .uppercase-legal {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .legal-content ul {
    list-style: disc;
    margin-left: 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .legal-content li {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .legal-content strong {
    color: var(--text-highlight);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .legal-content code {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.9em;
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
  }

  .legal-content a {
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    text-decoration: underline;
    transition: color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .legal-content a:hover {
    color: #7dd3fc;
  }

  .legal-callout {
    background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-active);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    margin: 1.25rem 0;
  }

  .legal-callout p {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .legal-crosslinks {
    margin-top: 3.5rem;
    padding-top: 2.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
  }

  .crosslinks-heading {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--accent-gold);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .crosslinks-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .crosslink-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    padding: 1.15rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .crosslink-card:hover {
    background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.12);
    border-color: var(--accent-purple);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .crosslink-title {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .crosslink-desc {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .legal-card {
      padding: 2.25rem 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
